+
+Proposed analysis: use `projoint::amce()` on the reshaped data, specifying the profile-choice outcome and respondent clustering if exposed by the package API; otherwise use an explicit OLS AMCE estimator (outcome regressed on attribute factors, with reference levels omitted) with respondent-clustered sandwich standard errors. Report effects in percentage points, construct 95% Wald intervals, and add zero-valued reference rows to a grouped horizontal dot-whisker plot.
+
